      "id": "claim_491581881e414d2988c72c292a8091b3",
      "statement": "`TaskAgent.run()` makes its explicit `goal` and `repo_path` authoritative, then selects the separate delegated pipeline only when `cfg.delegate` is true; otherwise it runs the legacy pipeline.",
