    {
      "id": "claim_453e581d19144249a9dd64d01a3671b2",
      "statement": "In legacy mode, repository analysis failure is a fail-fast condition, while implementation failure skips diff/test; otherwise the workflow analyzes, retrieves best-effort memory, plans, implements, diffs, optionally tests, and finalizes based on whether any recorded step failed.",
