      "id": "claim_77bfaf9c751340478a864d967b5c2da1",
      "statement": "Repository-memory retrieval is intentionally best effort: TaskAgent constructs/builds a repository index if possible and gets up to eight relevant context items, but unavailable memory construction or query errors return an empty context rather than failing the task.",
